# API

- Express + TypeScript. Run with bun. Agent host lives **only** here.
- Agent, Ollama, SQLite, sandbox, air-gap live **only** here. Next never calls Ollama.
- Call `installAirgap()` before any other import that uses `fetch`.
- Validate bodies with zod. Log with pino.
- Stream agent steps as SSE. Each event includes router `reason` when routing happens.
- Tools: `fs` (vault only), `isolated-vm`, tesseract, `docx`. No `eval`, no host-wide `child_process`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — UI-facing route that calls a public model host
await fetch("https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions", { ... });

// ✅ GOOD
await ollama.chat({ host: "http://127.0.0.1:11434", model, messages });
```
